  "description": "Given an integer array nums, move all the even integers at the beginning of the array followed by all the odd integers.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. i = 0, j = nums.length - 1\n2. while i < j:\n3.   if nums[i] % 2 == 0: i++\n4.   else if nums[j] % 2 != 0: j--\n5.   else: swap(nums[i], nums[j])",
  "steps": [
